    description: "SPLIT 2026-11-01 from WI-sipoj-nomij-morut-damim-savuv-gofob-lodin-zibum. Confirmed (dev 24d0b860ee; ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/p2_review_11012026/C1/fx_sipoj, sipoj_direct.log): utils.ll defines utility_func, main.ll declares it and calls it; with utils.ll enumerated first the call binds to the define; with main.ll enumerated first it binds to llvm_ir:main.ll:1-1:utility_func:declaration, and packages/hypergumbo-lang-extended1/tests/test_llvm_ir.py::TestAnalyzeLlvmIr::test_cross_file_call_resolution (:213) fails. MECHANISM: one name -> symbol map filled in file order with last-writer-wins and no definition-over-declaration preference. ACCEPTANCE: the call binds to the define in both orders; a declaration is chosen only when no define exists in the tree."  # 5174
